    "text": "Thursday, October 16, 2025\nThree fishermen, left, assess the situation Sunday at Beavertail State Park after authorities cautioned people from standing on the cliffs due to the rocks being slippery from crashing waves during the nor’easter, above. The National Weather Service issued a gale watch with “hazardous conditions” for the holiday weekend. PHOTOS BY ANDREA VON HOHENLEITEN",
